Subject: Replace the expired certificates in the tests

The certificates of the SNI server tests expired in April 2026 and the
certificate of the FTP test server in July 2026.  Generate the SNI
certificates at run time and use the regenerated FTP certificate, as
upstream does since PHP 8.2 (php-src 0f38bfdef2d and 011ad348683).
